{"TopicUser.find_by returns nil when no record exists for the user/topic combination, and calling .notification_level on nil will raise NoMethodError, crashing the unsubscribe flow": 0.933897078037262, "Typo in computed property name: stopNotificiationsText has an extra 'i' and should be stopNotificationsText": 0.5687404870986938, "The unsubscribe action immediately and silently changes the user's notification level on a GET request before presenting any UI, which can be triggered by email clients, browser prefetching, link-preview crawlers, or accidental clicks causing irreversible state change without confirmation": 0.9520130753517151, "Potential XSS vulnerability via unescaped triple-mustache {{{stopNotificiationsText}}} which renders user-provided topic title (fancyTitle) as raw HTML without escaping": 0.7337716221809387, "List-Unsubscribe header omits the per-topic URL - only the user-preferences URL is listed, but the new per-topic unsubscribe URL should also be included for RFC 2369/8058 compliance": 0.6447112560272217}